{%- case field -%}
{%- when 'group' -%}wellness
{%- when 'wellness' -%}
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Who is it for? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.who_is_it_for | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Someone with dry hair &amp; split ends<br> Anyone with frizzy and tangle prone hair<br> Someone who has a sensitive scalp<br> Anyone searching for a sulphate &amp; paraben free conditioning</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Ingredients <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.ingredients != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.ingredients | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>Distilled Coconut Water, Coconut Milk, Distilled Rose Water, Sweet Almond oil, Rose Glycerine, Aloe vera gel, Areetha Flaxseed extract, Sodium Cocyl Isothionate, Coco Glucoside, Lauryl Glucoside, Decyl Glucoside Vitamin E, jasmine Extract, Clove infused oil, Sandalwood infused Oil, Basil extract Geranium Essential oil, Phenoxyethanol (0.35%), Pathanol (0.55%), Geogard, infused Coconut oil.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What is it? <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.what_is_it != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.what_is_it | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>A shampoo blend that is most suited for dry and dehydrated hair. This formula uses coconut milk as the primary conditioning agent, making it safe for a sensitive scalp. It cleanses the scalp without stripping away any excess oils from it.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>What makes it different <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.why_it_is_unique | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p><span>This shampoo is made in a soap base made with coldpressed oils instead of palm oil, which is commonly used by brands. It has no artificial thickners or fragrance, and while the consistency is thinner than chemical shampoos, it is more effective in cleansing the hair. It uses Indic ingredients like coconut &amp; aloevera to condition the hair and retains the natural benefits of these ingredients as it is infused in brass vessels.</span></p>{% endif %}</div></details>
<details class="product-details wellness-details"><summary>Disclaimer <span>+</span></summary><div class="prose">{% if product.metafields.custom.disclaimer != blank %}{{ product.metafields.custom.disclaimer | metafield_tag }}{% else %}<p>A patch test is mandatory. If the product or a natural ingredient irritates your skin, please stop using it immediately. Please consult your naturopath or physician before using these products.</p>{% endif %}</div></details>
{%- endcase -%}
